    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">transŭo</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trans-sŭo</span></b> , sŭi,
			sūtum, 3, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to sew</i> or <i>stitch through; to pierce through</i> (not ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exteriorem partem palpebrae acu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 7, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mediam partem subulā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 5, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exta verubus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 363</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ad ipsas radices per medium acu duo lina
					ducente,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 7, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
